    <briefdescription>
<para>A cache of @llvm.assume calls within a function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This cache provides fast lookup of assumptions within a function by caching them and amortizing the cost of scanning for them across all queries. Passes that create new assumptions are required to call <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_assumption_cache_1a23187618f079555e127ba0e7b4581530" kindref="member">registerAssumption()</ref> to register any new @llvm.assume calls that they create. Deletions of @llvm.assume calls do not require special handling. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
